## 4. Recommended Pricing Model (4 Tiers)

| Tier | Name | Price | Features | Target |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | **Route** | $99-149/mo | Core routing, 6 modes, 3D map, schedule, client mgmt, visits log (50 clients, 10 nurses max) | Small agencies (1-10 nurses) |
| 2 | **Route+Clinical** | $299-399/mo | Tier 1 + AI voice SOAP notes, ICD-10 codes, patient signatures, offline SOAP (200 clients, unlimited nurses) | Mid-size (10-30 nurses) |
| 3 | **Full Stack** | $599-899/mo | Tier 2 + billing/RCM, claims, eligibility, denial mgmt, OASIS documentation | Growing (10-50 nurses) |
| 4 | **Enterprise** | $1,500-3K+/mo | Tier 3 + EHR integration, EVV, payroll integration, custom branding, API access, dedicated account mgr | Large enterprises (50+ nurses) |

### Volume / Per-Visit Options
- **Pay-as-you-go SOAP:** $0.15/note
- **Per-claim billing fee:** $0.75/claim
- **EVV per-visit:** $0.08/visit

