## 5. Revenue Projection (Conservative)

| Metric | Year 1 | Year 2 | Year 3 |
|---|---|---|---|
| Agencies onboarded | 50 | 200 | 500 |
| Avg monthly rev/agency | $250 | $400 | $600 |
| **Annual Revenue (subs)** | **$150K** | **$960K** | **$3.6M** |
| Billing % fee | +$30K | +$200K | +$750K |
| **Total Revenue** | **~$180K** | **~$1.16M** | **~$4.35M** |

30,000 home health agencies in the US. 2% in 5 years = 600 agencies × $750 avg = **$5.4M/year ARR**.

