## 6. Implementation Timeline

| Phase | Timeline | Features | Revenue Ready |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Phase 1** — Quick Wins | Week 1-6 | EVV compliance (geo-clock in/out), patient signature capture | Month 2 |
| **Phase 2** — Core Clinical | Week 6-12 | Structured SOAP notes, ICD-10 lookup, basic OASIS | Month 3 |
| **Phase 3** — High Value | Week 12-20 | AI voice-to-text SOAP (Whisper + LLM), billing/claim generation | Month 5 |
| **Phase 4** — Integration | Week 20-30 | EHR/FHIR integration, payroll integ, full RCM | Month 7 |
| **Phase 5** — Maturity | Ongoing | Patient portal, telehealth, advanced analytics | Month 9+ |

